    "title": "$50,000 Powerball winning ticket sold in Kentucky - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago LOUISVILLE, Ky. — The Powerball drawing Monday night produced a winning ticket of $50,000. Winning numbers were: 23 – 35 – 59 – 63 – 68 with a Powerball of 2. A winning ticket was sold at the Kroger fuel center 6767 Beulah Church Rd., Louisville, Ky. 40228. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
